OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV is cutting programmes and jobs at
OL,7,Ftwo of its regional operations. UTV is
OL,8,Fscrapping several non-news shows in
OL,9,FBelfast, and ITV Wales plans to end two
OL,10,Flong-running programmes in Cardiff.
OL,12,FIn Northern Ireland, four production
OL,13,Fjobs are at risk, and the programmes
OL,14,Fbeing dropped include UTV's
OL,15,Faward-winning current affairs series Up
OL,16,FClose, the Belfast Telegraph has
OL,17,Freported.
OL,19,FUTV is also ending Hidden NI, Life
OL,20,FTimes, True NI and its one-off event
OL,21,Fspecials.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
