OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new farming series filmed this year
OL,7,Fwill not return either. This follows
OL,8,Fthe earlier announcement that Mahon's
OL,9,FWay would end.
OL,11,FTwo of UTV's best-known programmes are
OL,12,Fbeing kept. UTV Life, presented by
OL,13,FPamela Ballantine, and the political
OL,14,Fprogramme View from Stormont, fronted
OL,15,Fby Paul Clark and Vicki Hawthorne, are
OL,16,Funaffected.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
