OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FUTV must broadcast 4 hours per week of
OL,7,Fnews and 2 hours per week of non-news
OL,8,Fprogramming under its Ofcom licence. To
OL,9,Fmeet that, the broadcaster plans to
OL,10,Fmove away from costly location filming
OL,11,Fand towards a cheaper studio-based
OL,12,Fformat.
OL,14,FThe new programme, which has the
OL,15,Fworking title The UTV Show, is expected
OL,16,Fto run as two half-hour episodes each
OL,17,Fweek.
OL,19,FIn Wales, ITV is proposing to end the
OL,20,Frural affairs series Coast and Country
OL,21,Fand the weekly arts and entertainment
OL,22,Fshow Backstage.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
