OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoast and Country has been on air for
OL,7,Fmore than a decade, covering rural
OL,8,Fcommunities, the environment and the
OL,9,FWelsh countryside. It has been
OL,10,Fpresented by weather presenter Ruth
OL,11,FDodsworth and Sean Fletcher.
OL,13,FMost ITV Wales staff were told about
OL,14,Fthe proposals on Tuesday morning, and a
OL,15,Fconsultation with staff is now under
OL,16,Fway.
OL,18,FBBC Wales reported that the number of
OL,19,Fproducers at ITV Wales could fall from
OL,20,Fsix to two. As in Northern Ireland,
OL,21,Fmore programmes may be made in the
OL,22,Fstudio rather than on location.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV Cymru Wales said the industry was
OL,7,Funder "significant economic pressure"
OL,8,Fand the changes would help ease some of
OL,9,Fthe cost pressure.
OL,11,FThe broadcaster said it would
OL,12,Frestructure some of the teams that make
OL,13,Fits English-language programmes so they
OL,14,Fcould work more flexibly, while still
OL,15,Fmeeting its commitments to viewers and
OL,16,Fto Ofcom.
OL,18,FITV Wales is required by Ofcom to
OL,19,Fproduce 4 hours per week of news and
OL,20,F1.5 hours per week of non-news
OL,21,Fprogramming.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
