OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV said the amount of news and current
OL,7,Faffairs it broadcasts in Wales each
OL,8,Fweek would not change.
OL,10,FITV is making 17 redundancies across
OL,11,Fthe UK.
OL,13,FThe cuts come as ITV prepares for the
OL,14,F#1.6bn sale of its channels and
OL,15,Fstreaming service, ITV X, to Sky. The
OL,16,Fproduction arm, ITV Studios, will
OL,17,Fremain a separate company.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14107
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe takeover is being examined by the
OL,7,FCompetition and Markets Authority and
OL,8,FOfcom, and may not be completed until
OL,9,Flate 2027. When the sale was announced
OL,10,Fin July, Sky said it was looking for
OL,11,F#200m in cost savings and warned that
OL,12,Fjobs could be affected.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday, ITV announced #30m of
OL,15,Ftemporary savings for the rest of the
OL,16,Fyear, mainly from programme budgets,
OL,17,Fafter warning that advertising revenue
OL,18,Fcould fall by up to 10% in the final
OL,19,Fquarter. At the time it said the plan
OL,20,Fwas not expected to affect jobs.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
