OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV announces cuts to programmes
OL,4,Cin Northern Ireland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cuts also follow a difficult year
OL,7,Ffor UTV, which in September reported
OL,8,Fits first annual operating loss in a
OL,9,Fdecade, of #1.4m, after a 20% fall in
OL,10,Frevenue.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
